venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# The OSM caches ARE committed, deliberately. Overpass is a shared public
# service and it went unreachable for half an hour during this build; a judge
# who clones this should not have to gamble on it being up. Committing ~9 MB
# turns "clone and run in two minutes" from a claim into a fact, and the data
# is ODbL-licensed OpenStreetMap content, attributed in the README.
#
# cache/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Launch-film build products. The sources (scene.html, render.mjs,
# capture_footage.mjs, check_claims.py) are committed; the stills and the
# encoded file are regenerated by running them, and together they are hundreds
# of megabytes that would dwarf the repository.
video/footage/
video/*.mp4
video/frames/
